msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"Hi, Riona-chan! What are you making that bento for?\r\n"
"Are you going on a date?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Yeah, though it's not gonna be just us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "...Is it with Mitsuo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "What? No!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Oh... Well, I think you two would be good together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"I know he's kinda immature sometimes, but you'd be happy\r\n"
"with him, Riona-chan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Look, it's not gonna happen, Haruka-chan!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "I just can't see myself dating a black guy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Riona-chan!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Sorry, that came out wrong..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Anyway, I have to go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"(Sounds like she doesn't like Mitsuo because he's different.\r\n"
"That's not how I raised her...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "What the heck? Riona nearly ran right into me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Taichi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Huh? Oh, hi, Uncle Kaz."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Aren't you supposed to be at the movies with Mitsuo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"I was gonna go, but then he told me it was some gross love\r\n"
"story! I don't wanna see that with him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "...And where is he now?"
msgstr "E dov'è adesso?"

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"I dunno, he just kinda walked off. He didn't look too\r\n"
"happy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Do you remember which direction he went in?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"Pretty sure it was over towards downtown. Oh, I bet he's\r\n"
"gonna go see that movie by himself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "(Hm. Sounds like I should check up on him.)"
msgstr ""

